      "content": "aspirin too? i already took a couple of advil like twenty mins ago for the muscle pain. if i take the aspirin on top of that, is that gonna be okay? i just really want to make sure i'm not making it worse by mixing them. also, do u think this is actually something i need to worry about like right now, or can i just try the pills and see if i feel better in an hour or two?",
